> r3(x: real in 0..1) = x^2
> range r3
range of r3:
  [0, 1]   min at x ≈ 0, max at x ≈ 1
  grid of 20001 points over [0, 1], extrema refined at critical points
> r5(x: i8) = abs(x)
> range r5
