> e5(x: real in 0..1) = (x+1)^2
> e6(x: real in 0..1) = x^2+2*x+1
> equiv e5 e6
e5 and e6 are equal on the domain of e5 (sampled, not proved; no SAT proof: a real value)
> e9(x: f64 in 0..1) = x/3
> e10(x: f64 in 0..1) = x*(1/3)
> equiv e9 e10
